<title>UK: Iceland sets 150 million mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Iceland sets 150 million mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF ICELAND</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -0.125    PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.847    FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.847</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/FFURT DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    3 BP	SELL CONC   7 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
